#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:99
#: 9d77cbd676574f5bae8dae8ea91f0f0c
msgid ""
"Be aware of how you connect ESCs wires to PWM rail. The signal wire (white "
"or orange color) should be connected at the top, the ground wire (black or "
"brown color) at the bottom."
msgstr "连接 ESC 线到 PWM 排针时请注意方向。信号线（白色或橙色）应连接在顶部，地线（黑色或棕色）连接在底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:105
#: 8288df158fec49d78029121a044e5bdf
msgid ""
"For Copter see :ref:`Connect ESCs and Motors <copter:connect-escs-and-"
"motors>`."
msgstr "Copter 请参见 :ref:`连接 ESC 和电机 <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:107
#: 7d4d3162cdde47df927830511a0a6e7c
msgid ""
"In overview, for copters connect each signal wire from the PDB to the main "
"output signal (S) pins by motor number:"
msgstr "概述：对于多旋翼，将 PDB 上的每根信号线按电机编号连接到主输出信号（S）引脚："

